0_AfwSHBliYNnn_cRPnTRi1Rj6wWsio4bqGrkfq_d5BrlHxA&oe=69BEA18A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MetaCoverLandscape.png", "id": "3060218317458956", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396955_3060218320792289_6166074712994379583_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0RP3hpcfaBEQ7kNvwFQklWy&_nc_oc=Adm9g-MFO0hN8OIuxXOvQMERvpYjYdFASEb63UPPyIrByOEJ-8CuKYakD-P_FB_cCMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzW63A8PQxo2BJoDFPvsBsMhKSt5hUYnmgC7ctj_e7ajg&oe=69BEA98C"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "**Catastrophic Inversion** is a multiplayer VR shooter made for **large shared spaces**, allowing players to naturally move among each other in massive levels with space-warping tricks to make them feel even bigger.\n\nCombatants face off in a variety of game modes including **Capture-The-Flag**, **Deathmatch**, and **Elimination**, with many adjustable settings. You can also mix and match win states to create your own custom modes.\n\n- **Joystick and Teleport Locomotion** are also available for those who don't have a large playspace available.\n- **Cross-play is available between Meta Quest and Steam**, as well as between stationary and real-space players.\n- **This PC edition can also function as a dedicated server and a spectator camera** for those not currently playing. If the game starts without a headset connected, it will automatically enter server/spectator mode.\n- The game can be played **completely offline** via a local Wi-Fi network, or **online through** a direct connection to **privately hosted servers**.\n\nWhile fully-playable as an arena shooter, we still have a lot planned. We are working on adding arenas, weapons, items, play styles, accessibility options, and quality-of-life features.", "short_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is a VR arena shooter made for large shared space